WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The work lives between the tools. Route events, people, agents, approvals and exceptions.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Turn an event into a workflow.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Route people, agents and software.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Retry failures; block unsafe states.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Escalate exceptions to a human.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Orchestrate the handoffs, not just apps.
